                                                "sense_id": "9fe7e685-5212-31de-aa64-f1fae5cfa82c",
                                                "text": "The \"Scotian\" is hardly a passenger train at all: typically, it consists of two 1,750 h.p. diesel units, four fish cars, five parcel cars, two mail cars, a baggage car, two passenger coaches and a sleeper which only goes part of the way."
                                            },
